{"id":98129535207266,"name":"D.I.G.","desc":"DIG IS IN BETA; Expect bugs and balancing issues. Thank you for your support. Join the community server to report bugs.\n\nHover Mouse over UI in bottom left corner to see tool controls.\nB - Quick Chat\n\nDIG is a sandbox shooter inspired by classic Roblox games!! Each match takes place throughout a valley whereby the goal is to capture the other team's base by fully lowering their flag.\n\nUse your shovel tool to dig trenches and fortify your base/FOB.\nGet utility and weapons from the radio to assist in your battle.\nTake victory swiftly, stockpiles only have enough food for 3 days of fighting.\n\nInspired by Foxhole, Trenches (Pordier at War), Underground War, Something Evil Will Happen, The W, and Dream Dive.","path":"/game/98129535207266-d-i-g","slug":"98129535207266-d-i-g","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5767cb24c3db18346e06d27f5cf80e43d8bb0ba45cd20fe453449147eeffc56b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cbf95b4c290c6dfd30d90a8074880846/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":36,"visitor":2475330,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-06-13T12:24:54.923Z","creator":{"name":"Kite Corporation","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a2d4c16e6d3df56ba631c70","title":"DIG UmbraHub Aimbot ESP Visibility","game":{"_id":"69a49d3ddadd365d072711b3","gameId":98129535207266,"name":"D.I.G.","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f8b42da0eaae077e021577de802bff7eee84eecaa9589829cc1065cfb5143fd1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-d096e5d53484f61b2f70712f7109d638-7e5e375fdfee.png"},"slug":"98129535207266-d-i-g","path":"/game/98129535207266-d-i-g","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f8b42da0eaae077e021577de802bff7eee84eecaa9589829cc1065cfb5143fd1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-d096e5d53484f61b2f70712f7109d638-7e5e375fdfee.png"},"placeId":98129535207266},